Package: com.minis.squidgesture
Name: SquidGesture
Version: 1.7.2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: System-wide gestures plus a right-side vertical app panel. Swipe left from the right edge to open a vertical column of your own apps (add/remove freely). Corner taps and multi-finger gestures also included.
Maintainer: Minis
Author: Minis
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), ellekit | mobilesubstrate
